flowchart TB
  accTitle: Cross-cutting Security and Assurance
  accDescr: Preventive, detective và recovery controls bao phủ Experience, Runtime, Data và Release, trong khi human authorities giữ quyền phê duyệt.

  subgraph ProductPlanes["Product Planes"]
    direction LR
    Experience["Experience Plane"]
    Runtime["Runtime Data Plane"]
    Data["Data & Knowledge Plane"]
    Release["Control & Release Plane"]
    Experience --> Runtime --> Data --> Release
  end

  subgraph Controls["Cross-cutting Controls"]
    direction LR
    Prevent["Preventive<br/>Identity · MFA · Scope<br/>Schema · ACL · Policy<br/>Consent · Rights · SBOM"]
    Detect["Detective<br/>Metrics · Trace · Audit<br/>Golden · Red-team · Shadow<br/>Data · Tool · Cost Anomaly"]
    Recover["Recovery<br/>Timeout · Circuit Breaker<br/>Rollback · Kill Switch<br/>Incident · Handoff · Restore"]
  end

  Human["Human Authorities<br/>Product · Architecture · Security · Privacy<br/>Data · Legal · Release"]

  Prevent -. controls .-> Experience
  Prevent -. controls .-> Runtime
  Prevent -. controls .-> Data
  Detect -. observes .-> Runtime
  Detect -. observes .-> Data
  Detect -. gates .-> Release
  Recover -. protects .-> Runtime
  Recover -. protects .-> Data
  Recover -. protects .-> Release
  Human -. approves .-> Release

  subgraph Legend["Legend"]
    direction LR
    LX["Experience"]
    LP["Runtime / Data"]
    LA["Assurance"]
    LH["Human authority"]
  end
  Human ~~~ LX

